===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|Aethiopia}}, from {{der|en|grc|Αἰθιοπία}}, from {{m|grc|Αἰθίοψ}}, of Proto-Hellenic origin. Displaced native {{ncog|ang|Siġelhearwena land|lit=land of the sun worshippers}}.

